68	   * Create a new DiskCache in the given directory with a specified max size and memoization
69	   * behavior.
70	   *
71	   * @param directory The directory for the disk cache
72	   * @param maxSize The max size for the disk cache
73	   * @param memoizePathNames Whether to memoize path names
74	   * @return The new disk cache with the given arguments
